-- No condition reads `salary`, `hours` or `flat`, and the ELSE arm divides by
-- `hours`, so a witness at which `hours` is zero raises. The report must name
-- the error and the input it raised at (smucclaw/l4-ide#1096).
GIVEN casual IS A BOOLEAN, salary IS A NUMBER, hours IS A NUMBER, flat IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hourly pay` casual salary hours flat IS
    IF casual
    THEN flat
    ELSE salary DIVIDED BY hours
